    {
      "id": "p0138-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Language dictionaries are an essential tool for any translator, but what happens when an author invents completely new words never seen before? This was a consistent issue during Underta/e's localization. Some problematic words included:",
