      "id": "p0138-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Even with Toby's input, however, each invented word became its own translation challenge. The localization team's general solution was to translate each invented word's intended meaning while adjusting the encompassing line to match the word's \"feeling\".",
        "raw": "Even with Toby's input, however, each invented word became its own\ntranslation challenge. The localization team's general solution was to translate\neach invented word's intended meaning while adjusting the encompassing line\nto match the word's \"feeling\".",
